diff --git a/docs/emulator.md b/docs/emulator.md
index 9443d4a..1cc18b0 100644
--- a/docs/emulator.md
+++ b/docs/emulator.md
@@ -28,6 +28,14 @@ BASIC is ready around frame 100; type after that.
 
 ## Input
 
+`-b-after FRAME` delays breakpoint dumps until FRAME, avoiding hits in loader/music
+code that occupied the same address before the game finished loading.
+
+`-swap FRAME:path.dsk` changes the inserted disk at the start of FRAME (up to 16 changes).
+CPU, RAM and head position are preserved; an unfinished transfer is cancelled. Disk writes
+remain in memory only and are discarded when that disk is removed. Use keys separately
+to acknowledge a game's request to turn the disk over.
+
 | Option | Effect |
 |---|---|
 | `-type 'FRAME:text'` | Types text from FRAME (3 frames down, 3 up per key). `\n` = RETURN. Upper case and `"|!#$%&'()*+=?<>_` press SHIFT. Several `-type` allowed. |
